This page records a later analysis of the reports merged into #4471. The original incident page remains as the historical account of the desk’s initial triage. This page separates the reports by the cause assigned by the knowledge base rules.

<Callout kind="warn">
The intake tag is a guess based on the reporter’s browser locale. The classification below uses the tenant’s locale, form version, and report channel.
</Callout>

## Cause breakdown

The table calculates its counts from the deduplicated report export and links each cause to its issue in the public challenge repository.

<ProblemBreakdown />

## What the categories mean

- **Parser:** the shared parser reads dates month-first, which flips dates for tenants whose locale writes the day first.
- **Form hint:** booking-v3 displays a month-first date hint for tenants whose locale writes the day first.

